# Build-context allowlist. Runtime data, secrets, local backups, tests, and the
# archived Python reference must never be sent to a Docker builder.
*
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!docker-entrypoint.sh
!stations.json
!frontend/
!frontend/**
!src/
!src/**
!data/
!data/**
!web/
!web/**

# The frontend is rebuilt in the builder stage; do not transfer a stale local
# artifact even though the frontend source itself is allowlisted above.
frontend/node_modules
frontend/build

# Re-included source trees must not make local credentials part of a build
# context. Keep these rules after the allowlist so they also apply below src/,
# frontend/, data/, and web/. Character classes make the policy case-robust on
# hosts whose filesystems preserve mixed-case filenames.
**/.[Ee][Nn][Vv]
**/.[Ee][Nn][Vv].*
**/.[Ee][Nn][Vv][Rr][Cc]
**/.[Nn][Pp][Mm][Rr][Cc]
**/.[Nn][Ee][Tt][Rr][Cc]
**/[Cc][Rr][Ee][Dd][Ee][Nn][Tt][Ii][Aa][Ll][Ss]/**
**/[Ss][Ee][Cc][Rr][Ee][Tt][Ss]/**
**/*[Cc][Rr][Ee][Dd][Ee][Nn][Tt][Ii][Aa][Ll]*
**/*[Ss][Ee][Cc][Rr][Ee][Tt]*
**/*[Tt][Oo][Kk][Ee][Nn]*
**/*[Pp][Aa][Ss][Ss][Ww][Oo][Rr][Dd]*
**/*.[Kk][Ee][Yy]
**/*.[Pp][Ee][Mm]
**/*.[Pp]12
**/*.[Pp][Ff][Xx]
**/*.[Pp]8
**/*.[Kk][Dd][Bb][Xx]
**/[Ii][Dd]_[Rr][Ss][Aa]
**/[Ii][Dd]_[Ee][Dd]25519
